WEBVTT

00:02:26.625 --> 00:02:31.083
pain, prison and poverty.

00:02:32.292 --> 00:02:38.684
I was raised by brilliant, beautiful
and accomplished black women.

00:02:38.708 --> 00:02:42.101
Even so, my pops wasn't in the picture,

00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:45.601
and I couldn't resist
the allure of the streets.

00:02:45.625 --> 00:02:47.059
Like Biggie said,

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:50.708
you're either slinging crack rock
or you got a wicked jump shot.

00:02:51.875 --> 00:02:54.000
Don't get it twisted, my jumper was wet.

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:56.559
(Laughter)

00:02:56.583 --> 00:02:57.851
My shit was wet.

00:02:57.875 --> 00:03:01.809
(Applause)